{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p092a","title":"曹操上还三县封户","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p092a-account","label":"《魏武故事》所载令文","text":"曹操令文提出归还阳夏、柘、苦三县二万户，只留武平万户。","evidence":["wudi-e-p092a-q","wudi-q-p089"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"请减封户","evidence":["wudi-e-p092a-q","wudi-q-p089"]}],"place":{"text":"阳夏、柘、苦、武平","evidence":["wudi-e-p092a-q","wudi-q-p089"]},"time":{"label":"建安十五年十二月己亥","year":210,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-p092a-q","wudi-q-p089","wudi-q-o126","wudi-q-b-ee0c0fb3013218aec86b"],"chronology":"wudi-y210","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o126","basis":"建安十五年十二月己亥","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,726,"P092a"],"order":298}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-p092a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5a8393b850bbcea0c0ba","layer":"pei","quote":"然封兼四县，食户三万，何德堪之！江湖未静，不可让位；至于邑土，可得而辞。今上还阳夏、柘、苦三县户二万，但食武平万户；且以分损谤议，少减孤之责也。”","attribution":"《魏武故事》所载令文","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":50,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e46e3191255096f1e405","start":0,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-ee0c0fb3013218aec86b","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ee0c0fb3013218aec86b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖12〗十五年：建安十五年（公元 210）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":32,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1cc8bff8736e92ce7836","start":0,"end":22,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o126","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4d2f95c3f31b3ee562eb","layer":"original","quote":"十五年春〖12〗，下令曰：“自古受命及中兴之君〖13〗，曷尝不得贤人君子与之共治天下者乎〖14〗？及其得贤也，曾不出闾巷〖15〗。岂幸相遇哉〖16〗？上之人（不）求〔取〕之耳〖17〗！今天下尚未定，此特求贤之急时也。‘孟公绰为赵、魏老则优〖18〗，不可以为滕、薛大夫〖19〗’。若必廉士而后可用，则齐桓其何以霸世〖20〗？今天下得无有被褐怀玉而钓于渭滨者乎〖21〗？又得无盗嫂受金而未遇无知者乎〖22〗？二三子其佐我明扬仄陋〖23〗，唯才是举〖24〗。吾得而用之。”","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":18,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":233,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p089","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-afa8b9bba71a9c9899f7","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏武故事》载公十二月己亥令曰：","attribution":"《魏武故事》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":47,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e46e3191255096f1e405","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
